Oke. Eh, kedengarannya bagus.

1045
01:21:41,101 --> 01:21:42,436
Baiklah, beri kami waktu sebentar?

1046
01:21:42,537 --> 01:21:44,639
Ya, kapan pun kamu siap. Oke. Terima kasih.

1047
01:21:50,043 --> 01:21:52,614
